Hello,

the latest upstream version 1.17.0 of Doxygen has been rewritten to drop
its build dependency on JQuery which means it can be build again without
NodeJS which is not available on all of Debian's architectures [1].

Can you please update the package to 1.17.0 and drop the build dependency
on uglifyjs?

Thanks,
Adrian

> [1] https://github.com/doxygen/doxygen/issues/7363

